WEBVTT

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.750
<i>0-3-3, 0-3-5,</i>
<i>0-3-8, no contact.</i>

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:10.800
<i>Roger.</i>

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.880
<i>0-2-1, 0-2-2, 0-2-9.</i>

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.800
<i>White three, White four.</i>
<i>Blue one, Red two, all clear.</i>

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:21.180
<i>Roger.</i>
<i>Drop a sonar buoy at 3-3-0!</i>

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.480
They're really
giving this their best.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.240
We just got a personal dispatch
from the captain of Blue 6.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.030
Read it.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:39.620
"If we get lucky on our end,
feel free to help us out."

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:42.910
"I'll buy drinks for you
at next month's party."

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.080
On his little salary?
Okay, let's take her down.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.710
Time to drive Zorndyke
out into the open.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.090
Yes, sir!

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:00.890
What a mess...

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:31.920
This is no place for
anyone to be living in.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.550
A real hotshot, huh?
Better than me?

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:43.970
Seems he's in the salvage business now.
A freelance submariner.

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:50.560
Why do we have to
call in an outsider?

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:54.150
Please don't ask me.
We were ordered to, right?

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:17.510
Mr. Hayami?

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:31.190
Mr. Hayami.
I know you're in here!

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:56.960
My name's Mayumi Kino.
I've come from Blue 6.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:03.550
Please...

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:06.350
Please, come back to Blue Fleet!

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:14.310
We need your skills
as a submariner!

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:17.730
We can't take on Zorndyke
the way we are now!

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:20.280
We... We're mankind's last...

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:23.410
How old are you?

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:26.700
Eighteen.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:38.420
Blue Fleet is going to counterattack
Zorndyke's forces!

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:45.970
Enemies killing other enemies.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:51.020
He's the destroyer of the world.
The worst criminal in history!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:55.310
I don't believe you.
I'll never forgive what he did! I...

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.110
You don't agree with me?

00:03:58.610 --> 00:03:59.780
How much?

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.240
My guarantee.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:06.240
Well... Maybe
if you came back to Blue...

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:08.030
I'm headed to Brunei tomorrow.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.540
I landed a new job.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.290
Now leave.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:20.000
Please, think this over.
This operation is vital!

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:24.050
Even the captain... You're a
friend of the captain's, right?

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:26.180
This is a personal
order from him.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:29.810
He is asking you to join
the Grampus team...

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:32.060
Get out!

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:33.640
I'm not leaving!

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:39.310
I... I have a lot
riding on this mission, too!

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:43.650
If we don't do something now,
it really will be too late for our world!

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:45.320
It already is too late.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:49.200
No matter what we try now,
it won't work.

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:53.000
What can we do?
Can we change anything?

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.870
This ruined world of ours!

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:01.630
It doesn't matter any more.
Nothing does.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:05.670
Hey, why don't you come
with me tomorrow?

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.800
Just screw the career thing
and join me.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:10.890
There's still stuff in this world
worth saving, right?

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:19.520
Didn't you know what I do?

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:23.150
Precious metals, jewels,
valuable securities...

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:25.740
weapons, even nuclear materials.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.530
I'm a freelance salvager
who'll go after anything.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:34.620
You don't need to say it.
I'm a hyena of the sea.

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:41.540
Pretty much everything is sunk under
the sea. Everything became garbage.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:45.340
And they wanted me to keep diving
into it! Silly, huh?

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:49.510
But I changed.
Maybe I couldn't change the world...

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:53.060
but I could change myself
and find a life to live.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.360
No good, huh?

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:08.950
What's with that guy?
He makes me sick!

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:10.410
Wanted some conditions, huh?

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.910
Contact the boat.
We're going back.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:14.790
Aye, sir!

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.120
We're now returning to the boat.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.620
Estimate we'll be there
by 14:00 hours, over.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:24.880
CZ-9i, CZ-9i, this is Mega Mouse.
Please respond, over.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:29.090
Aye, sir. We contacted the target
as planned, but without success.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:30.970
We're now returning to the boat.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:33.600
Estimate we'll be there
by 14:00 hours, over.

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.190
Damn it!

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.520
<i>Lost it?</i>

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:42.310
Yes, sir.

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:44.440
Don't panic.
Let's try to reacquire it.

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:46.820
Turning to 3-0-5!

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.280
We can't keep up with it,
can we?

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.620
Can't hear it.
No reaction on the magnetometer.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.040
It's going after Blue 6,
isn't it?

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:05.920
This is OUR backyard. I won't let
that thing lay a finger on them!

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:27.880
Damn that Verg. He's even more
persistent than I thought.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.000
Our firepower is much more
stronger than last time.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.510
We'll smash 'em with no problem.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:35.180
If Hayami comes back to us.

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:38.720
We don't need a man who won't come.
We can handle them fine on our own!

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:45.350
Go to it.

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:20.260
<i>Mankind stands between</i>
<i>the heavens and the earth...</i>

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:25.270
<i>and there are those who strain</i>
<i>to hear the voice of heaven.</i>

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:31.310
<i>In my case, though, I listen for</i>
<i>the voices of the sea and the land.</i>

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:44.410
You're from Blue Fleet,
right? Do something!

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.080
- Blast those things!
- Are you trying to escape to the sea?

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:54.340
Good luck!
We're counting on you!

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:13.060
Somebody! Somebody,
let us on, please.

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.440
Take us to Blue Fleet's dock.
Please!

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:16.280
Hey!

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:28.370
<i>Mankind stands between</i>
<i>the heavens and the earth...</i>

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:39.510
<i>In my case, though, I listen for</i>
<i>the voices of the sea and the land.</i>

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:45.100
<i>Mankind stands between</i>
<i>the heavens and the earth...</i>

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:49.850
God dammit! God dammit!

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:54.360
<i>In my case, though, I listen for</i>
<i>the voices of the sea and the land.</i>

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:59.490
<i>Leave. You should return to the land.</i>

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:18.880
Jump!

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:32.560
That was dangerous!

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.610
The China Sea
is always dangerous!

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:43.030
Departure route B-3.
Engines, one-third!

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:44.740
Course ahead reads clear.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:47.240
Message from our patrol plane.
They've lost sight of the enemy!

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:51.370
- Activate Lorenzinni System! ASW!
- ASW, standing by!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:54.040
Message from Mega Mouse. They'll
rendezvous with us in five minutes.

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.830
And it looks like
they have a guest.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:01.090
We've heard from Musuca!
Blue 6 has left port.

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:04.930
So, they've made their move, eh?

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:07.100
Let's hit them now, Verg!

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:10.390
No, wait. We'll let Musuca
handle this for now.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:14.020
You won't escape
this time, Blue 6!

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:23.610
Status board check on our watertight
and drainage systems.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:25.610
- Check, okay.
- Welcome back.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.780
Well, so you didn't get the visitor
we had planned on, did you?

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:30.160
No, sir. It all went to plan.

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:37.040
It's been a long time, Hayami.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:41.460
It seems you've saved
some of my precious crewmembers.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:42.960
I have to thank you for that.

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:45.550
I was just passing by, so...

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:48.220
I see.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:49.800
Captain, we're ready to dive.

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:51.640
All right, let's go!

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:55.810
Maintain course on B-3, mode: quick!
Take us down to 40 and hold there.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:58.900
Maintain main motor
output at one-third!

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:00.820
Flood forward ballast tanks!

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:02.980
- Dive!
- Dive!

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:07.820
- Kino! Send out the Turtle.
- Aye, sir!

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:10.990
Musuca One. We estimate
it carries 12 Kumos.

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:13.410
We think Verg's command ship
is somewhere outside of the bay,

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.500
but we haven't found it yet.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:18.500
We'll handle Musuca.
You take care of any small fries.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:21.500
You think it's coming?
That thing?

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:25.010
The Phantom Ship.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:34.770
Does it take you back?

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:40.440
We'll be launching soon.
Get in back.

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:42.020
I'm staying here.

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:45.320
What are you talking about?
This is a high-performance machine!

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:47.240
You can't handle the
front after all this time!

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.200
Are you even listening to me?

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:52.410
<i>Chamber flood in one minute.</i>
<i>Get that thing buttoned up.</i>

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.370
Standing by. Okay.

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:00.880
Tell me why.

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:03.210
<i>Why did you come to save us?</i>

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:05.380
Tell me why.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:09.380
Why do you try so hard?

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:14.720
Because it's my city.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:20.230
<i>My home is</i>
<i>on the bottom of the sea now.</i>

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.700
- Three Kumos, dead ahead!
- Let 'em have it!

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:39.250
<i>- Grampus, moving out!</i>
<i>- Good luck, Kino!</i>

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:51.090
Whoa! Are you sure
you can handle this?

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:53.760
Two Kumos, right below us!

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:03.610
- Let's take her down!
<i>- Behind us! Behind us!</i>

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.530
Only one round left!
You have to be more careful...

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:11.450
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.550
Should we switch to active, sir?

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:36.050
No, not yet. Not yet.

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:41.940
<i>Head for the shallows!</i>

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:07.670
With all the terrain clutter, there're
too many noise and heat sources.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.840
- Anything on the Lorenzinni?
- Nothing.

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:14.680
Set enzyme warheads to homing
and deploy launchers.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:19.680
I don't like this.
I've got a bad feeling.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:22.430
It's close.

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:28.480
Don't! Look out!

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:31.980
Get away from it now!
It's the enemy.

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:37.280
Stand aside!

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:38.650
Don't kill her!

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:29.060
It's begun.

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:46.780
Microphone 7.
Are those sharks? No!

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:47.570
Torpedoes!

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:48.910
Return fire, dead ahead!

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:51.120
Tubes 5 and 6, A.T.C.B. FIRE!

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.880
Tubes 0 and 1, C-ADCAP! FIRE!

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:34.000
It's coming right for us!

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:35.120
It's so fast!

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:38.500
40 degrees up trim.
Ahead full speed!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:41.750
Open rear launchers. All hands,
grab onto whatever you can!

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:43.550
Depth now 35... 30...

00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:47.470
25... 20... 15... 10...
We're going through the roof!

00:22:09.410 --> 00:22:11.200
Rear tubes 3 and 4, FIRE!

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:30.050
Another shot.

00:22:31.010 --> 00:22:31.970
Incoming!

00:22:39.390 --> 00:22:40.060
What?

00:22:42.650 --> 00:22:43.610
It's the Narushio!

00:22:50.990 --> 00:22:55.080
Rear tubes 0, 1, 5, and 6!
Snap shot! FIRE!

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:35.450
Why?

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:40.160
Why did you let it go?
It was the enemy!

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:44.630
What was that thing?

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:48.130
A monster.
One that Zorndyke created.

00:23:51.130 --> 00:23:52.470
One of Zorndyke's...

00:23:58.890 --> 00:24:03.440
What... What exactly has begun?

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:11.860
What they want is to kill
every last one of us.

00:24:22.080 --> 00:24:24.500
Dead! Musuca is dead!

00:24:24.620 --> 00:24:27.290
Musuca? Musuca!

00:24:28.250 --> 00:24:29.670
Revenge!

00:24:30.170 --> 00:24:32.800
- Revenge!
- Revenge!

00:24:32.920 --> 00:24:34.180
Revenge!

00:24:44.230 --> 00:24:48.310
Not bad, Blue 6. However...

00:24:48.570 --> 00:24:51.530
Blue 6! Blue 6! Blue 6!

00:24:52.440 --> 00:24:55.910
Now they'll be at their
most careless, won't they?

00:25:32.860 --> 00:25:37.420
<i>Ne ikenai anata ni fureta
Tell me, is it wrong? I want to touch you.</i>

00:25:37.420 --> 00:25:40.310
<i>Kasanaru yori fukai
Deeper and deeper into you.</i>

00:25:40.310 --> 00:25:42.200
<i>Sweet whisper...</i>

00:25:42.200 --> 00:25:46.820
<i>Modokashi ore
I want to vanish...</i>

00:25:46.820 --> 00:25:50.000
<i>Takata ni kieta
...into the foam in the tantalizing orange light...</i>

00:25:50.000 --> 00:25:53.570
<i>Tsuki e no michi wo
Will the moonlight path on the waves...</i>

00:25:53.570 --> 00:25:58.620
<i>Anata e to tsuzuku kashira
...lead me to you, I wonder...</i>

00:25:58.620 --> 00:26:03.130
<i>Wasurerarenai atsui manazashi
I can't forget that warm gaze...</i>

00:26:03.130 --> 00:26:07.610
<i>Soshite amai toiki
...and that sweet sigh.</i>

00:26:12.000 --> 00:26:15.640
<i>Susarei de lullaby
That whispered lullaby...</i>

00:26:21.010 --> 00:26:25.020
<i>Eien lullaby
That eternal lullaby...</i>

00:26:25.550 --> 00:26:29.910
<i>Come whisper to me and touch me...</i>

00:26:29.910 --> 00:26:34.390
<i>Tokimeki wa ren'ai kotoba wa ren'ai
I'm dizzy from my beating heart, don't need any words now.</i>

00:26:34.390 --> 00:26:37.580
<i>Whisper love...</i>

00:26:54.530 --> 00:27:03.380
<i>Setsunaku ayamii anata no toiki ni
Your dangerous sigh that almost breaks my heart...</i>

00:27:03.810 --> 00:27:06.570
<i>Just whisper...</i>

00:27:07.130 --> 00:27:11.040
<i>...and love sweet touch.</i>

00:27:21.360 --> 00:27:30.340
<i>Setsunaku ayamii anata no toiki ni
Your dangerous sigh that almost breaks my heart...</i>

00:27:30.340 --> 00:27:34.380
<i>Sweet whisper... dakaredai
Sweet whisper... I want to embrace you...</i>

00:27:34.380 --> 00:27:36.630
<i>...and love sweet touch.</i>

00:27:37.060 --> 00:27:39.120
<i>Mitaretai
I want to go mad...</i>

00:27:39.290 --> 00:27:48.140
<i>Setsunaku ayamii anata no toiki ni
Your dangerous sigh that almost breaks my heart...</i>

00:27:48.480 --> 00:27:52.200
<i>Sweet whisper... Mitaretai
Sweet whisper... I want to go mad...</i>

00:27:52.200 --> 00:27:54.980
<i>...and love sweet touch.</i>

00:27:54.980 --> 00:27:57.280
<i>Kutsuretai
I want to crumble away...</i>

00:27:57.280 --> 00:28:01.700
<i>Agareru omoe wa
These burning feelings...</i>

00:28:01.700 --> 00:28:06.150
<i>Mina soko ni nemure
...are sleeping deep inside of everyone.</i>

00:28:06.680 --> 00:28:11.420
<i>Yume tsumeru made
Until we awaken from this dream...</i>

00:28:11.900 --> 00:28:13.820
<i>Sweet whisper...</i>

00:28:14.840 --> 00:28:22.240
<i>Mina soko ni nemure...
Sleeping deep inside everyone...</i>

00:28:39.380 --> 00:28:43.380
<i>Blue Submarine No. 6.</i>
<i>Episode 2: "Pilots."</i>
